0 FILE study-9a9d88973837-00-10159---airplane.ldr
0 Passenger airplane with a red and white fuselage, swept white wings with blue stripes and twin jet engines, a glazed cockpit windscreen and a row of passenger windows, red tail surfaces and a tail plane, wheeled landing gear and red/green navigation lights
